<title>GERMANY: DSL Bank 9-mth operating profits up.</title>
<headline>DSL Bank 9-mth operating profits up.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to September 30.</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group oper profit before provs     164	 vs 158</p>
<p>    Group interest income		  221	 vs 214</p>
<p>    Group commission income		 38	 up 11.6 pct</p>
<p>    Group balance sheet total	 92,700	 up 14,000</p>
<p>    Group administration costs	    94	 vs 99</p>
<p>    Group personnel costs		   67	 vs 69</p>
<p>    Group fixed costs			 27	 vs 30</p>
<p>NOTE - Name is Deutsche Siedlungs und Landesrentenbank AG. Comparative 1995 profit figure was three-quarters of full-year figure. The bank gave no figure for its own-account trading performance. It said that risk provisions were likely to be down this year, meaning that profits could be expected to post a double-digit percentage rise for full-year 1996.</p>
<p>-- Bonn newsroom, 49-228-2609710</p>
